{
  "summary": "The experiment tested weighted fusion in a multimodal setup using PCA-encoded RNA and ResNet50-encoded images, comparing to the previous concat fusion baseline (llm_summary_001). Validation accuracy of 0.5232 (vs 0.5266) and F1 of 0.5084 (vs 0.5104) suggest weighted fusion may not improve performance compared to concatenation, though the difference is small. The role of fusion strategy in multimodal performance remains uncertain without further comparison to other strategies or unimodal baselines."
}

